--- title
# Kaduo

--- body
Social commerce, short-form video and live broadcasting with a browser-based production studio.

--- actions
[Product](https://kaduo.shop/) · [Portfolio](/en/#products)
:::

::: section architecture
## Architecture

Kaduo is organized around three areas: a social and commercial application, a media pipeline and a live production interface.

- **Application:** creator profiles, feeds, product catalog, shopping interactions and live-session management.
- **Production studio:** camera and microphone capture, Canvas composition, scene elements and a video track generated from the composed image.
- **Live media:** WebRTC publication, media ingestion, distribution and playback.
- **Recorded media:** browser recording, video uploads and video-on-demand playback.
- **Real-time interactions:** live chat, audience events and studio status updates.

The video stream and the commercial application exchange session and product information through application services.
:::

::: section technologies
## Technologies

- **Frontend:** React, TypeScript, Vite, Canvas API, MediaStream, MediaRecorder.
- **Live video:** WebRTC, WHIP, OvenMediaEngine, Mux.
- **Video uploads and playback:** tus, Bunny Stream.
- **Application services:** NestJS, WebSocket / Socket.IO.
- **Data:** PostgreSQL, Prisma, Redis, ClickHouse.
:::

